nodes.body:
@ch-wan, could you please review this small server-argument validation fix when you have a chance? I saw your recent review of the ServerArgs fix in #38958 and thought you might be a good fit.

The current CI is blocked by the missing `run-ci` label. Could you help authorize and trigger the relevant tests? Lint has passed, and the focused CPU regression suite passed all 7 tests on an H20 host with GPUs hidden; the two relevant `dp_size=1` subcases fail on the upstream baseline.

This only clarifies the TBO error when DP attention is disabled at `dp_size=1`; it does not add GLM-5.3-Flash TBO support. If another maintainer would be a better reviewer, a pointer would be appreciated. Thank you!

